      88→
      89→## 5. Testing Strategy
      90→
      91→### 测试命令（与 v4 相同）
      92→```bash
      93→# 1. Build
      94→cd snake && go build ./...
      95→
      96→# 2. Vet
      97→cd snake && go vet ./...
      98→
      99→# 3. Unit tests with timeout and race detection
     100→cd snake && go test -timeout 5m -race ./...
     101→
     102→# 4. E2E screenshot
     103→cd snake && ./scripts/e2e-screenshot.sh
     104→
     105→# 5. Verify .cast file is non-empty and valid
     106→test -s snake/screenshots/*.cast
     107→head -c 1 snake/screenshots/*.cast | grep -q '{'
     108→
     109→# 6. Verify .cast files are git-tracked
